Text:
You may scrap up to two cards from your hand and/or discard pile. Draw cards equal to the number of cards scrapped this way, then discard an equal number of cards.
<hr>
{Alignment Ally (Machine Cult or Star Empire)}: {Gain 6 Combat}

{Gain 1 Combat}
<hr>
{Star Empire Ally}: You may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.

{Gain 1 Trade}
<hr>
{Machine Cult Ally}: Choose a card of cost two or less in your discard pile. Put it on top of your deck.

{Gain 2 Combat}
<hr>
{Star Empire Ally}: Target opponent discards a card.

{Scrap}:
{Gain a Star Empire Ally} {Gain a Machine Cult Ally}
You may scrap a card in your hand or discard pile. If you do, draw a card.
